  "title": "tp-link 7350 v2.0 (UN/EU) – confirmed working",
  "body": "Hi, I can confirm that the XYZ v2.0 (UN - should be EU) works. I can access the web interface, there are no top warning bars, but there is a smiley face on the right side of the display.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I bought a fairly old device, as no one on eBay mentions the hardware version number. I’ll give it a try without the warning bar, at least I can access the web interface and start my ray hunt that way.\r\n\r\nAs an additional hint for people without a colour display: something like a hyphen or an “X” could be a good indicator when you come across one.",
